# review/06-consuming-failure-builder
profile own
failure stop typed Stop
scope.begin caller
defer caller emit d
new a A
# Later argument fails before callee entry: admission remains here.
scope.unwind caller stop
check dA
scope.begin builder_scope
builder.new b0
new element B
builder.push b0 b1 element ok
new rejected C
builder.push b1 b2 rejected fail
# Failure before commit leaves b1 and the fresh C unchanged.
builder.abandon b1
scope.unwind builder_scope stop
